      "options": {
        "content": "## AGI Safety Observability Dashboard\n\n**Three-Layer Architecture:**\n- **Layer 1**: AGI Operations (self-evaluation, rollback decisions)\n- **Layer 2**: Circuit Breaker Guardian (independent veto authority)\n- **Layer 3**: Immutable Audit Log (hash-chain integrity)\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n- Circuit breaker state should stay CLOSED (green)\n- Failure count should stay below 3 to prevent circuit opening\n- All low-confidence rollbacks should be blocked\n- Execution time changes > 30% trigger regression detection\n\n**Incident Prevention:**\nThe Dec 2, 2025 incident (33% confidence rollback deleting critical files) would now be blocked by the 70% minimum confidence threshold.",
